{"1344170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sudden Way", "steam_appid": 1344170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.poster.avif?t=1782825977\" width=958 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.webm?t=1782825977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.mp4?t=1782825977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudden Way</strong> is a retro-inspired 2D pixel art platformer that takes you on a dangerous journey through mysterious worlds filled with deadly traps and unexpected challenges. Jump, survive, and make your way through handcrafted levels as you search for the path back home. Inspired by classic arcade platformers, the game combines nostalgic gameplay with a modern pixel art style and smooth controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric environments, overcome difficult obstacles, and face a powerful portal master responsible for your strange journey. Every level brings new dangers that will test your timing, precision, and platforming skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a stylish soundtrack inspired by classic hip-hop, creating a unique atmosphere for your adventure. Whether you're a fan of retro platformers or simply enjoy challenging gameplay, <strong>Sudden Way</strong> offers a classic experience with its own personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforming and dangerous traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battle against the mysterious portal master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hip-hop inspired soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.poster.avif?t=1782825977\" width=958 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.webm?t=1782825977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344170/extras/272b7748ef55ed3e1c7097e68a4930bc.mp4?t=1782825977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudden Way</strong> is a retro-inspired 2D pixel art platformer that takes you on a dangerous journey through mysterious worlds filled with deadly traps and unexpected challenges. Jump, survive, and make your way through handcrafted levels as you search for the path back home. Inspired by classic arcade platformers, the game combines nostalgic gameplay with a modern pixel art style and smooth controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric environments, overcome difficult obstacles, and face a powerful portal master responsible for your strange journey. Every level brings new dangers that will test your timing, precision, and platforming skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a stylish soundtrack inspired by classic hip-hop, creating a unique atmosphere for yo